msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "???「What!? Nishida-kun, you're...... getting＿married? To Miki!? R-Really!?」"
msgstr "???「¡¿Qué?! Nishida-kun, ¿te...... vas a＿casar? ¡¿Con Miki?! ¡¿D-De verdad?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Who's that shouting in the middle of＿the street......? Seems the voice came＿from over there.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¿Quién está gritando en medio＿de la calle......? Parece que la＿voz viene de por allá.）」"

msgid "???「I, I see～ The wedding? I'll go! Of course＿I'll go...... Yeah, mmhmm.＿Congratulations ① Okay, bye.」"
msgstr "???「Y-Ya veo～ ¿La boda? ¡Iré! Claro＿que iré...... Sí, ajá. ¡Felicidades!＿① Bueno, adiós.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Phone call, huh? Oh, that's......＿Koigakubo Yuri-san, I believe.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Una llamada, eh? Ah, esa es......＿Koigakubo Yuri-san, creo.）」"

msgid "Yuri「......Uggggh. I'll probably have to talk to＿Miki now too～」"
msgstr "Yuri「......Aaaagh. Seguro ahora también＿tendré que hablar con Miki～」"

msgid "Yuri「She'll say something like \"Oh,＿Koigakubo got asked out. Seems she＿still doesn't have a man～\"」"
msgstr "Yuri「Dirá algo como: \"Ah, invitaron＿a salir a Koigakubo. Parece que＿sigue sin tener hombre～\"」"

msgid "Yuri「We're both in our thirties! Why!? Why!?」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Treintañeras! ¡¿Por qué?! ¡¿Por qué?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I don't really get it, but life at 30 must＿be complicated......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No lo entiendo bien, pero la vida a＿los 30 debe ser complicada......）」"

msgid "Yuri「If you're going to talk to me about＿wedding details, don't ask me how I've＿been, just get right to the point. That」"
msgstr "Yuri「Si me vas a hablar sobre los detalles＿de la boda, no me preguntes cómo he＿estado, ve directo al grano. Esa」"

msgid "Yuri「\"we decided to get married to＿compromise on our faults\" crap, that's＿just obvious.」"
msgstr "Yuri「basura de \"decidimos casarnos＿para compensar nuestros defectos\"＿es más que obvia.」"

msgid "Yuri「......*Gasp*! But if marriage is about＿faults, why wasn't I chosen!? I went so＿far as to act like it was some」"
msgstr "Yuri「......¡Ah! Pero si casarse se trata de＿defectos, ¡¿por qué no me eligieron?!＿Hasta llegué a actuar como si fuera un」"

msgid "Yuri「mouth-watering meal to look forward＿to, so why not me!?」"
msgstr "Yuri「manjar apetitoso que esperar con ansias,＿¡¿entonces por qué yo no?!」"
